# AI Change Log — 2026-09-17

## MERGE-07 — Farmer GreenFin workflow

- Replaced the farmer-side legacy evidence／sustainability-proof workflow with the GreenFin digital profile.
- Added farmer navigation and six GreenFin work areas: overview, documents／OCR, green actions, green experience, four independent indicators and Data Health.
- Connected document upload, OCR field confirmation, normalization, verification and rule-based recalculation to the GreenFin APIs.
- Added `/api/greenfin/actions` for farmer-owned green action listing, creation and deactivation with shared GFES authentication, CSRF enforcement and evidence ownership checks.
- Kept the product boundary visible in the UI: GreenFin outputs are not credit scores or automated lending decisions.
- Updated rendered-HTML and farmer workflow coverage for the new GreenFin navigation and prohibited-result terminology.

